From 808de7ed4f68926af2a940b340695d580bcc0565 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nikita Yushchenko <nikita.yoush@cogentembedded.com>
Date: Fri, 28 Jan 2022 17:45:20 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 020/151] dts: renesas: vc4: clenup

- merge into single file (no need to have cpu.dtsi when there is no
  separate cpu board)

- sort alphabetically

- remove definitions stale from other board(s)

- define scif-clk pinmix in scif-clk node

- add vcc-supply to EEPROM node, to avoid warning in logs

Keep for now two settings that are wrong but somehow workaround boot
hangs. Namely, disable &gpio4 and don't enable &pciec1.

Signed-off-by: Nikita Yushchenko <nikita.yoush@cogentembedded.com>
---
